\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-06-16\\n\\nT005 (containerize the CipherDoc API and CLI into a Docker image, WS-03) reaches its first milestone today: the initial Dockerfile is complete.\\n\\n## Next Step\\n\\nBefore this can be treated as release-ready, the image needs a size review and a CVE check. Neither has run yet against this build.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src gdoc 06 docker packag initi dockerfil complet owner evan document key doc 2006 last updat 2026 06 16 t005 container the cipherdoc api and cli into a docker imag w 03 reach it first mileston today the initi dockerfil is complet what s includ a work dockerfil that packag both the api and cli entri point into a singl imag sourc id src gdoc 06 docker packag initi dockerfil complet owner evan document key doc 2006 last updat 2026 06 16 t005 container the cipherdoc api and cli into a docker imag w 03 reach it first mileston today the initi dockerfil is complet next step befor this can be treat a releas readi the imag need a size review and a cve check neither ha run yet against this build\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e9ea95aa8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-06-16-Docker-Release-Notes.md\", \"id\": \"ad9dfc8f80d70ef0\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3258788649701916, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.1182454899574165, \"vector_similarity\": 0.81035674, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-06-16-Docker-Release-Notes.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e9ea95aa8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-06-16-Docker-Release-Notes.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-06-16-Docker-Release-Notes.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 553, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_da