ce (PM), Bob (Backend), Charlie (Engine), Diana (QA), Evan (DevOps)\\n\\n## Transcript\\n\\n**Alice**: We're in pre-release mode. Gate check first: Docker slim-down and CVE work is still open, Windows signing is still open, and we're still blocked upstream on the high-DPI rendering bug. Those stay on the board. Diana, where are we on the audit-log gate?\\n\\n**Diana**: Still a hold. The CLI path and the log records aren't matching the schema we defined. That undercuts the audit trail as release evidence.\\n\\n**Bob**: I've been wiring audit-log generation into the CLI. The shape coming out still isn't consistent with what the schema expects — I've got another pass queued.\\n\\n**Charlie**: So this isn't a packaging issue — it's schema versus emitted records?\\n\\n**Diana**: Yes. Until those match, I can't clear the audit gate.\\n\\n**Evan**: That stacks on top of the Docker and Windows holds Alice listed. Release isn't opening with any of those unresolved.\\n\\n**Alice**: Correct. Security-gate work stays open — Docker slim-down, Windows signing, and we keep the audit mismatch visible as a release blocker. No one closes those today.\\n\\n**Diana**: I'll keep the audit-log gate red until schema and records match.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src meet 10 firefli transcript pre releas audit date 2026 09 15 particip alic pm bob backend charli engin diana qa evan devop summari pre releas gate review docker slim cve window sign and upstream high dpi remain open audit log path still a hold cli schema and emit record don t match sourc id src meet 10 firefli transcript pre releas audit date 2026 09 15 particip alic pm bob backend charli engin diana qa evan devop transcript alic we re in pre releas mode gate check first docker slim down and cve work is still open window sign is still open and we re still block upstream on the high dpi render bug those stay on the board diana where are we on the audit log gate diana still a hold the cli path and the log record aren t match the schema we defin that undercut the audit trail a releas evid bob i ve been wire audit log generat into the cli the shape come out still isn t consist with what the schema expect i ve got anoth pas queu charli so this isn t a packag issu it s schema versus emit record diana yes until those match i can t clear the audit gate evan that stack on top of the docker and window hold alic list releas isn t open with ani of those unresolv alic correct secur gate work stay open docker slim down window sign and we keep the audit mismatch visibl a a releas blocker no one close those today diana i ll keep the audit log gate red until schema and record match\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e94edcc88a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/fireflies/2026-09-15-Pre-Release-Audit.md\", \"id\": \"be17298264309b61\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2782845366078098, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.08096394086829971, \"vector_similarity\": 0.73869926, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/fireflies/2026-09-15-Pre-Release-Audit.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e94edcc88a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/fireflies/2026-09-15-Pre-Release-Audit.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/fireflies/2026-09-15-Pre-Release-Audit.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1495, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:03:06\", \"token_count\": 424, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-SLACK-39\\n\\n# Slack Thread: License Audit\\n\\n**Channel**: #cipherdoc\\n\\n**Date**: 2026-08-09\\n\\n---\\n\\n**[2026-08-09 11:13] Diana**: Starting the third-party license audit across the dependency tree — need a full inventory before we sign off on anything for release.\\n\\n**[2026-08-09 12:37] Alice**: Watch closely for GPL or AGPL. Our client agreements rule out shipping copyleft code in the core engine.\\n\\n**[2026-08-09 12:46] Diana**: That's exactly what I'm scanning for, using license-checker against the dependency manifests to flag anything outside MIT/Apache/BSD.\\n\\n**[2026-08-09 13:19] Bob**: Are you following transitive dependencies too? A clean top-level library can still pull in something restrictive underneath.\\n\\n**[2026-08-09 13:24] Diana**: Yes, doing a recursive pass, not just the direct dependencies.\\n\\n**[2026-08-09 13:51] Evan**: Want a hand with the Docker base image layers once the app-level scan is done?\\n\\n**[2026-08-09 14:07] Diana**: That'd help. Still working through the results — nothing conclusive to report yet, I'll have the full inventory soon.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src slack 39 slack thread licens audit channel cipherdoc date 2026 08 09 2026 08 09 11 13 diana start the third parti licens audit across the depend tree need a full inventori befor we sign off on anyth for releas 2026 08 09 12 37 alic watch close for gpl or agpl our client agreement rule out ship copyleft code in the core engin 2026 08 09 12 46 diana that s exact what i m scan for use licens checker against the depend manifest to flag anyth outsid mit apach bsd 2026 08 09 13 19 bob are you follow transit depend too a clean top level librari can still pull in someth restrict underneath 2026 08 09 13 24 diana yes do a recurs pas not just the direct depend 2026 08 09 13 51 evan want a hand with the docker base imag layer onc the app level scan is done 2026 08 09 14 07 diana that d help still work through the result noth conclus to report yet i ll have the full inventori soon\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"